# Live City - Git ignore

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Large raw datasets
data/raw/

# Large generated 24-ward building datasets (P1-4). Regenerate with:
#   node tools/build-ward-building-datasets.js                              (nested, data/processed)
#   node tools/build-ward-building-datasets.js --layout flat --out public/map-data/osaka-city/buildings --force   (P1-5 servable)
# The per-ward counts / tileCount / bbox / unclassified breakdown are kept in
# data/reports/building-dataset-generation.json (committed).
data/processed/osaka-city/buildings/
public/map-data/osaka-city/buildings/

# P1-6 都市レイヤー tile（道路・河川・公園・鉄道）と Overpass raw キャッシュ。再生成:
#   node tools/download/city-tiles.js --layer all --area osaka-city        (ローカルPC / ネットワーク必要)
#   node tools/build-city-layer-tiles.js --layer all --public --force
# 生成数・validator 結果は data/reports/city-layer-tiles-*.json（コミット）に保持。
# （data/raw/ は既に上で除外済み。Overpass raw キャッシュは data/raw/osaka-city/_cache/ に置く）
data/processed/osaka-city/roads/
data/processed/osaka-city/parks/
data/processed/osaka-city/railways/
data/processed/osaka-city/waterways/
public/map-data/osaka-city/roads/
public/map-data/osaka-city/parks/
public/map-data/osaka-city/railways/
public/map-data/osaka-city/waterways/

# Temporary/generated working data
temp/

