# Nested duplicate repository
/livecity/

# [Mission 31C] canonical roads の derived tile（42,547 feature・約 70MB）。再生成:
#   node tools/build-canonical-roads.js
# manifest / validator 結果 / preview は data/reports/canonical-road-*.json（コミット）に保持。
data/processed/osaka-city/canonical/roads/

# [Mission 31D] canonical buildings の derived tile（615,000+ feature・約 250MB）。再生成:
#   node --max-old-space-size=4096 tools/build-canonical-buildings.js
# manifest / validator 結果 / preview は data/reports/canonical-building-*.json（コミット）に保持。
data/processed/osaka-city/canonical/buildings/

# [Mission 31C2] PLATEAU tran 変換の中間 polygon（取得後にローカル生成）。
data/processed/osaka-city/canonical/roads-tran/
data/raw/plateau/
