data/processed/osaka-city/canonical/rail/
data/processed/osaka-city/canonical/resolved/
data/processed/osaka-city/derived/
data/reports/derived-preview/
public/map-data/osaka-city/derived/
# [Mission 31G-FIX16] GSI 道路縁 normalized line（実データ・~150MB級）。raw ZIP は元々 data/raw/ 配下で除外済み。
