data/processed/osaka-city/gsi-road-surface-v2/
public/map-data/osaka-city/gsi-road-surface-v2/
# [Mission 31G-FIX18] GSI corridor-level reconstruction v3（edge-tracks/corridor-pairs/prototype-surfaces）。
data/processed/osaka-city/gsi-road-surface-v3/
public/map-data/osaka-city/gsi-road-surface-v3/
# [Mission 31G-FIX19] Hybrid GSI road surface prototype（provenance.json が全大阪 45MB級のため除外）。
data/processed/osaka-city/gsi-road-hybrid-v1/
public/map-data/osaka-city/gsi-road-hybrid-v1/
